OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1789478912
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 30 Sep to Wed 14 Oct
OL,6,FMore changeable weather may become
OL,7,Festablished more widely as we move
OL,8,Finto October, though parts of the west
OL,9,Fand northwest are perhaps most likely
OL,10,Fto see wet and windy conditions at
OL,11,Ftimes. As is not untypical as we move
OL,12,Ftowards mid October, deep low pressure
OL,13,Fsystems could bring occasional periods
OL,14,Fof very strong winds. Temperatures are
OL,15,Flikely to remain above normal overall,
OL,16,Fthough brief cooler interludes are
OL,17,Falso possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
